Figure 7: 2-dof Proprotor Model [164]
The governing equations of motion (Equation 1) include contributions from various forces and moments acting on the system. In addition to conventional inertia, damping, and elastic forces, the rotating propeller introduces gyroscopic and aerodynamic forces.
