Aerodynamic terms, on the right-hand side of Eq. 1, include the net effect of the vertical force Lz and the pitching moment My and the horizontal force Ly and the yawing moment Mz. The rotation of the propeller also affects the natural vibration modes, as shown in Figure
8.
